    "No producer attestation or legal as-of fact is inferred from TemporalScope, manifest profile identity, producer metadata, or publication as_of_time.",
    "ADR-0148's Lex legal_snapshot barrier is independent of SameInputClosure identity; missing legal evidence remains blocked for legal-dependent claims.",
    "The exact-view invariant should apply to every CAS-view pointer in SameInputClosure through one typed owner/wire mechanism; do not patch only time_context_ref. Non-CAS references stay in their own typed identity domains.",
    "No additional CAN tag-policy question is opened: AD-E02-05 and IR-Q1/Q2 are already selected. The existing raw-mapping public API-domain choice remains pending between the linked .3 lossless-map path and .2 typed refusal.",
    "The G local decision branch is five commits ahead of its remote pointer; no automatic merge, rebase, or publication is included.",
    "No source copies, raw data dumps, integration tests, or code changes were made in this handoff.",
